<title>SINGAPORE: ST E&amp;E wins $12 mln contract.</title>
<headline>ST E&amp;E wins $12 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's ST Electronic and Engineering Ltd (ST E&amp;E) said on Wednesday it had won a US$12.2 contract to supply and install an intelligent building management system in the Chinese city of Pudong.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the system would be installed in the 88-storey Jin Mao building, destined to be a trade and finance centre and the tallest building in Pudong.</p>
<p>Work had already started on installing the system and was scheduled for completion in the third quarter of 1998, it said.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom 65-870 3080</p>
